UnitIcttMessenger
└── when deploying the messenger
    ├── given valid inputs
    │   └── it exposes every configured value
    ├── given a gas limit that is zero or a recipient limit not below the required limit
    │   └── it reverts with IcttMessenger_InvalidGasLimits
    ├── given a zero address in any address input
    │   └── it reverts with IcttMessenger_ZeroAddress
    └── given a zero destination blockchain id
        └── it reverts with IcttMessenger_ZeroBlockchainId
